su name headquarters approval policy be map def
  su name supported actions ob ve text "send" "delete" "purchase" "publish" "calendar-mutation" ya
  su name action send ob text "sensitive" ya
  su name action delete ob text "sensitive" ya
  su name action purchase ob text "sensitive" ya
  su name action publish ob text "sensitive" ya
  su name action calendar-mutation ob text "sensitive" ya
  su name unsupported action ob text "defective" ya
  su name default sensitivity ob text "sensitive" ya
prah

exists su name headquarters approval policy be export ya
